 [center][size=6][b]Incidental Steal[/b][/size][/center]

[b]Description[/b]
This mod updates the [b]Incidentals Skills (steal/attack/heal/analysis)[/b] passive skills so it works with pretty much all actions
for [b]Octopath Traveler 0[/b] using [b]UE4SS[/b].

[b]Requirements[/b]
[list]
[*]Octopath Traveler 0
[*][url=https://github.com/UE4SS-RE/RE-UE4SS/releases/tag/experimental-latest]UE4SS experimental latest[/url] — scroll down and download the release asset named like [code]UE4SS_vX.X.X-XXXX-gXXXXXXXX.zip[/code]
[/list]

[b]Installation[/b]
[list=1]
[*]Locate your [code]UE4SS\Mods[/code] folder [code]Octopath_Traveler0\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods[/code]
[*]Extract the content of the archives into the mods folder
[*]Launch the game.
[/list]

[b]Notes[/b]
[list]
[*]Make sure UE4SS is installed and working before using this mod.
[*]If the mod does not load, verify the folder name and file placement.
[/list]

[b]Uninstallation[/b]
[list=1]
[*]Close the game.
[*]Remove the [b]Incidental Steal[/b] folder from [code]UE4SS\Mods[/code].
[/list]

[b]Credits[/b]
UE4SS devs

